      "preview": "确认后，VitAgent 会先创建一个项目历史安全检查点。\ngenapi_generate [confirm]: Generate audio through a configured generation-API provider (unified adapter template: user fills provider dialect/base_url/api_key/model in the genapi provider config). Submit, poll and download are one call; artifacts land on disk and, when track_id is given, ride the existing assets.ingest_generated_asset path onto the timeline as candidate takes. The yue_local dialect (local YuE2 engine) takes an ABC dialect score via abc plus lyrics and English style tags — score-level hard control. Errors come back classified (auth/quota/rate_limit/provider/timeout/network/response_parse).\n{\"agent_action_id\":\"act_0112aff544ad1040\",\"cmd\":\"genapi_generate\",\"count\":1,\"duration_seconds\":55,\"goal_id\":\"goal_5209c70dd6c17dea\",\"instrumental\":false,\"lyrics\":\"一闪一闪亮在窗边\\n月亮轻轻走过屋檐\\n今晚的风 慢慢吹\\n把白天的累吹得好远\\n一闪一闪 小小的光\\n陪我说一句 晚安\\n一闪一闪 陪我今晚\\n睡进星星的臂弯\",\"musical_key\":\"C major\",\"prompt\":\"温柔童谣风格，像《小星星》那样简单重复的旋律，慢速，轻声哼唱，夜晚安静的氛围，简单的钢琴或八音盒伴奏\",\"provider_id\":\"yue-local\",\"run_id\":\"run_83e7aad2cc27e21d\",\"style_tags\":\"童谣, 摇篮曲, 温柔, 慢速, 夜晚\",\"tempo_bpm\":72,\"title\":\"今晚的小星星\",\"tool_call_id\":\"tool_step_1\"}",
